			"notes": "This is the first coordinated release on GitHub, Modrinth and CurseForge.\n\n# Code Changes\nThe mod now uses dynamic registries. This means that generators now support things like tags and inline fields.\nExisting generators will not break, but the name of the field (currently `Type`) may change in the future. You can also now inline a generator config directly instead of referencing one. Their location in datapacks also moved."
